# Coding Rules
Everytime you make update to the codebase, rebuild the whole project.

If you cannot build because the app is currently running, just kill the app and retry. Do not skip building.
**IMPORTANT** Do not close the game for any reason! If needed to, stop, ask me to close the game with your valid reason.

**IMPORTANT** everything you implement must put performance as top priority.

Always find the simpliest way to solve the requirement. Do not over-complicating it. If the current investigation/debugging method is taking a long time without succeed, re-think rightaway about other approach.

If you don't really sure about something in the game, ask me to do A/B testing so you can scan and figure out what is different between 2 scenarios. Do not guess. Guessing is forbidden! Everything must be based on fact that can be checked.